            <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-[#2D3440] text-[12px] uppercase tracking-[0.12em] mb-4 border-b border-[#D6D0C2] pb-4">
              <span class="flex items-center gap-1"><Icon name="video" size="sm" /> 50h</span>
              <span class="flex items-center gap-1"><Icon name="download" size="sm" /> Vid&eacute;o 4K</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-[15px] leading-[1.65] text-[#5B6270] mb-5 typ-body">Plus de 50h de contenu vid&eacute;o HD, accessible &agrave; vie depuis chez vous.</p>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between pt-5 border-t border-[#D6D0C2]">
              <div>
                <span class="text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#4A5565] typ-meta">&Agrave; partir de</span>
                <div class="font-heading text-[44px] md:text-[50px] lg:text-[56px] leading-none text-[#162231]">145&euro;</div>
              </div>
              <Button href="/masterclass" class="bg-[#BBA86B] hover:bg-[#A89558] !text-black border-none" size="sm">
                Devenir Premium
