      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-start lg:items-center justify-between gap-6 mb-10">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-6">
            <h3 class="font-heading typ-section leading-[1.04]">
              <span class="text-[#EEF4FF]">Prochains </span><span class="text-[#5EC7C5]">Ateliers</span>
            </h3>
            <div class="hidden lg:block h-px flex-1 min-w-[260px] bg-[#375776]"></div>
          </div>
          <p class="text-[15px] text-[#D6DEEC] mt-3 typ-body">Rejoignez-moi en pr&eacute;sentiel pour une exp&eacute;rience immersive et personnalis&eacute;e.</p>
        </div>
        <a href="/ateliers" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-primary-turquoise text-[#EBFAFF] px-6 py-3 text-[12px] uppercase tracking-wider rounded-sm typ-button">
          <Icon name="clock" size="sm" /> Voir le calendrier complet
